Z||000000||Hank is Here||12-20-2001||10:04 AM||||This past Saturday I graduated from Penn State University with a BS in business logistics. Yeah me!<P>Monday when I am at home got an email from the college saying that of the 80 people in my major, 12 had jobs.  <P>Tuesday I got a call with a job offer!   I'll be staying in the Pa area.  The job is in Lititz with a large consumer goods/consumer pharmaceutical/ pharmaceutical company.  <P>Just glad to get a position in a good company  when the economy is this way.  <P>Mark <BR>aka Hank||||reg||1
